# Parent03 independent source review

Decision: **accepted for the narrowly corrected source layer**. No remaining material finding was reproduced within the assigned residual HUP3 scope. This disposition is not an execution release or a genuine outcome assessment.

The reviewed source is `held-consumer-one-use-parent-preparation03-2026-10-03/launch_success01.py`, SHA256 `7a197e2f57db3fff44fce453356d187f62dce5f119125e6814831eb6008f38dc`; its author manifest is `28cffe50f86395f6e5145db28a87a383a27a7b0f3c577ed6735faf9f1ecacc00`. All 34 manifest members were independently joined to retained names, types, modes, lengths and hashes. The original withheld Parent01/02 reviews and witnesses remain unchanged.

## Corrected residual finding

`directory_identity` (line 264) now fsyncs the acquired directory and its parent, then rejoins their original identities. `launch` (lines 487–492) applies this to the attempt entry and exclusive identity reservation before child creation. The independent real-file check observed the exact four fsync targets: attempt, containing directory, identity directory, attempt. A transient pre-fsync reservation is not an authorization to launch. This establishes the implemented acquired-current-IO-scope contract, not an atomic directory-birth capability or a hardware durability guarantee.

`open_log` (line 346) creates only the two permitted logs with O_EXCL/O_NOFOLLOW relative to the held original directory, checks the actual file/parent identities, and fsyncs the new file and directory. The exact previous redirected-parent log-loop witness now refuses without creating a foreign log. Same-mode replacement with a different directory inode also refuses. The successful returned log descriptor remains open; a subsequent pathname replacement cannot redirect writes through that original descriptor.

`log_join` (line 388), the monitoring loop (line 532), and independent final joins (lines 558–565) now compare actual descriptors with current original paths and parents. The retained opaque-file witness wrote to the original renamed file while the replacement stayed unchanged; the final join refused. Stable final joins are recorded before closing all acquired log descriptors. Log size monitoring remains sampled; the independent native file cap is a separate control.

Injected fsync MemoryError with later ordinary close failures preserved the identical first fatal object and closed each of three log-acquisition descriptors once. The corresponding directory-acquisition case closed both descriptors once. Partial log initialization and independent final actions were inspected. No actual controller, original native unit, or research process was invoked.

## Preservation and source joins

Whole-module inverse AST equality holds after removing the two new helpers and restoring only `directory_identity` and `launch` to Parent02. Previously corrected post-tail reader/global bindings, independent TERM/wait/KILL/wait handling, authentic parser CleanupFailure selection, receipt IO, genuine outer route, resource criteria and scientific configuration are unchanged by this candidate.

The independent check used the actual selected semantic source reader against the original capsule and verified 205 committed source/metadata bodies, all 33 registered input hashes as opaque bytes, and the six declared output paths. It did not decode arrays or import NumPy, Torch or SciPy. `READBACK03.json` retains these exact joins. `CHECK03.log` records the successful bounded reviewer run; `check03.py` and its tiny original/replacement files are retained with their complete inventory.

## Remaining boundary

The actual installed parent, concrete release/request and documentary review bindings, complete baseline capture and genuine external recovery, fresh resource/dedup checks, actual native enforcement, actual Run/Owner/Target outcome and post-tail closure remain separate release and execution requirements. The source review does not establish a successful positive `prepared`/`finish_check` invocation, a model fit, memory capacity, numerical agreement, financial validity, or transport authority. No claim, budget adoption, source integration or historical rerun occurred. The genuine capsule and all author evidence were left unchanged.
